"about.privacyTitle": "Privacy Policy",
"about.privacyUpdated": "Last updated: ",
"about.privacy.s1": "1. Who we are\n\"My Schedule\" is developed by Kzure Lab. It is a fully offline local application. No login or network is required.",
"about.privacy.s2": "2. What we collect\nWe do not collect any personal information. All data (courses, teachers, students, scores, etc.) is stored on your local device and never uploaded to any server.",
"about.privacy.s3": "3. Data storage\nAll data is saved as JSON files in the program directory (or %APPDATA%\\CourseApp). You can open, backup, copy, or delete these files at any time.",
"about.privacy.s4": "4. Third-party services\nThis app does not use any third-party analytics, ads, or tracking services. The optional news feature fetches headlines from a user-specified RSS URL only.",
"about.privacy.s5": "5. Your rights\nYou have full control of your data. Delete the program directory to uninstall completely with no leftovers.",
"about.privacy.s6": "6. Contact us\nFor privacy questions, please use the project homepage.",

"about.cookieTitle": "Cookie Notice",
"about.cookie.s1": "1. What are cookies\nCookies are small text files that websites store in your browser to remember your preferences.",
"about.cookie.s2": "2. This app does not use cookies\n\"My Schedule\" is a desktop application, not a website. We do not use cookies, LocalStorage, SessionStorage, or any browser storage.",
"about.cookie.s3": "3. Local configuration\nWe only save a config.json file in the program directory to remember your theme, language, and window position. This file stays on your device and is never uploaded.",
"about.cookie.s4": "4. To reset\nDelete the config.json file in the program directory to restore all settings to defaults.",

